Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome！Welcome！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congrats，Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy smokes，everybody's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。and Mrs。Loughran，the parents of the groom，and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mom and Dad！- Johnny！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，how hot is my date？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,So hot。Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,How 'bout how hot mine is？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a date？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。She's invisible。That's why you can't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。This is the one from 「Canada」？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wedding's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,True。So true，Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw。How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my。Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it everything you wanted，my little poisonberry？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it is，Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except where's Grandpa Vlad？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，your gramps would not have been cool with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's old-school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do we know？If he could just meet Johnny…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,He would have eaten him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:05:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not as enlightened as your hip Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you're really okay with him not being a monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Human，monster，unicorn，as long as you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And you'll always be my moonlight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But now on wings of love you soar ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Now that you're Johnny's girl ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Johnny's girl ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And kind of Daddy's，too ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Your mom would be so happy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 'Cause she always knew ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Love is making room for all the best in you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，guys！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Todd，take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis was wondering if maybe you wanted to go for a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。We haven't done that in forever。Any special reason？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No special reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Mavey？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's his deal？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a beautiful night，and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if you don't want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！Are you kidding？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would eat a bucket of garlic to fly with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，honey，look at those fluffy clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember what we played when you were little？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hide and Go Seek Sharp Objects？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Regular Hide and Go Seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honeybat！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavey！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honeybat！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey？Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。It's just a little harder
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,to catch my breath since I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，well，I guess that would make it more…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a grandpa！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be a dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 'Cause you're Daddy's girl，or boy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Daddy's girl，or boy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hungry again，honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you get me some ice cream with anchovies？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。You mustn't give in to your cravings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not good for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to increase your spider intake，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,so he'll be able to climb ceilings properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And eat lots of sheep bile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Dad，but we don't even know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,if the kid's gonna be a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be thrilled if the baby's human-y，just like Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Human-y.」 With thousands of years of Dracula genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as the baby's healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。A healthy little vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，a human who can fly as a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。Just have some monster ball soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your mommy's recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like you made it when I was a kid。My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，only the father is allowed in the delivery room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I mean，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the family，I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，look！It's a boy！It's a boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dracula bloodline carries on！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one will ever harm you as long as I'm here，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,my little devil dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，can I hold my baby？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I were Dad，I'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm the nurse，Francine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you go anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Little Dennis is a year old now。Wow！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice。Yeah。Cute kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，time for presents，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Let's do this boy up！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check out what I got him。Bling！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Is it cursed？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Super cursed。Only the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Straight from the crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just starting to walk，so maybe it's heavier than…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。You're okay，Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,His name is Dennis。Named after my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not his vampire name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,My little Denisovichy-Weesovichy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh！Are we sure he's a vampire？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，not that it's a bad thing，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,but shouldn't he have fangs and that pasty skin you guys have？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Technically，you have until you're five
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,to get your vampire fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he'll get his fangs。He's a Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's also half Loughran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he'd be better off where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's more humans there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Look how well he's playing with the wolf pups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a present。I hope it's acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「My First Guillotine.」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very educational。Well played，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's great。Thank you。We just have to baby-proof that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny，do you know where you put the rubber guards？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby-proofing a guillotine？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you cut your finger off。It's part of the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,She made me baby-proof the whole hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone's overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny！Come quick！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up？He's okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis said his first word！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He did？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，honey。Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't say，「Bleh，bleh-bleh.」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't say you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then where did he get that？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，maybe sometimes you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only say it when I say I don't say it！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，kid。We get it。You can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just checking for cavities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was you！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my goodness，Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you really looked that hideous，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I could hang out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，what's the deal？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this a party？Pick up a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care if Johnny said it's a 「cool app.」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny's still new here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Porridge Head，did you call a hearse for the Gremlinbergs？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're checking your Facebook page。Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac，I told the guys social media
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,is the best way to promote the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Clifton？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Drac，I wanted to go through some thoughts I had，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,as your new human relations coordinating co-assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。It's a real job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a cheap excuse to keep Mavis happy，so you never leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。So，I was thinking，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,since we have so many humans now，maybe update some of the acts？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like，maybe the magician？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Harry Three-Eye？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he might be a little old-school for the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，sir，what was your card？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The three of spades？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this your card，my friend？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Harry's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't blame Harry for the crowd not being hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，what about Wayne？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne？Are you nuts？He's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then maybe something other than tennis？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，so，what you wanna do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,is lift the racket right on impact，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,so you get that nice top spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try and hit one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？What's the noise？It's on me！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just the cell phone I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clifton's sending you a text
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,so you can practice how to write back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the… It's not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear Drac，gar ugha gjergh arggh grgrgrhgr
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you can text Clifton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you do this？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's your fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's easy。Look。I'll text Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Psyched for date night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？And now look，she texted right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta cancel。Can't leave Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we never allowed to be alone again？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to feel loved，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And send.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。All that taught me is that you're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，got it。Maybe you should just get Bluetooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Blue Tooth，come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，now what？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rise and shine，my Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，my little devil。Did you have sweet nightmares？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-huh。I dreamed that I saw a stegosaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh… And were you drinking his blood？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just throwing it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！You want to do something cool？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you how to turn into a bat。Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See？- Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Cool，like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat。I'm a bat。I'm a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，a real bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich。Take a breath。You can really turn into a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try。Feel the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？The electric boogaloo？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I show you I can bust a move，will you try to fly，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？Why are you guys dancing？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，he was sleep-dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，sweetie。Back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Back to bed」？It's already after 8：00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you remember the new sleep schedule？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's going to human classes half the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he could just sleep till 2：00 A.M。tonight，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,it'd be so great for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，honeydeath，six of Wayne's wolf pups
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,are having a birthday party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want him to miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，I love the wolf pups，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they're a little too rough for Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Too rough」？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed？Dennis is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you saying？Denisovich shouldn't be around monsters？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love monsters！Video！Video！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you wanna show Papa Drac your monster video？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the coolest monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wee！Kakie one happy monster！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie love cake！Yummy！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tummy get a tummyache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa。How is that a monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have some cake，Wuzzlelumplebum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，kids，a real monster always shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Shares」？Yes！When I think monsters，I think 「shares.」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，let me tell you what a real monster is，Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，please。He's practically five already。Don't force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slow down，Wuzzlelumplebum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Twinkle，twinkle，little star How I wonder ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy，I'm too old for lullabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？That's not how that one goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the way most people sing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Most people」？What's wrong with…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Suffer，suffer，scream in pain ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Blood is spilling from your brain ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Daddy。- Come on。You know how I sang it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Zombies gnaw you like a plum ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Piercing cries and you succumb ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Suffer，suffer，scream in pain ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ You will never breathe again ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy birthday，Wally，Wilson，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoopi，Waylon，Weepy and Wanye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich！My big boy！You made it！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought about what you said，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I was being a little overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，coffin cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！I love you！Zing！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Winnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just love your yummy strawberry locks！Zing，zing！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winnie。Give him his space，hon。I'm sorry，Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，Aunt Wanda。They're just playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy rabies！Limbo？I used to love that game！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there，Mavey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？But I'm a parent now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show 'em how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Okay，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way！A pinata？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Mavis，honey。That's for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't want the pups to have too much…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Candy！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。Did I start all that？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。There's a reason they call it a litter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.87,0:21:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！Your tooth came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me？He got his tooth knocked out？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，indeed。Here comes the fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad。His baby tooth wasn't a fang。Why would this one be？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sun's gonna come out soon，and we gotta get to his classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the classes we have here？Like the kids' yoga？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yoga！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Denisovich's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What don't you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we've been talking about moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.81,0:22:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somewhere safer for Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe where Johnny grew up in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，but you can't just make somebody something they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，honey。We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavey，wait。You can't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in on this？The leaving？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… It's not definite at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just something she's definitely talking about，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,but until we do it，it's not definitized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he just cover me with birdseed？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he covered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.73,0:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，it's not a fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，I don't know if it's the right place for Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Johnny？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:23:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，dudeman。It's not me。It's Mavey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，dudeman。I'm afraid to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，dudeman。I'm a dudeman！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，Drac？Who you talkin' to？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not disturb。The count's wiggin' out in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you wiggin' out about，Drac？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,The kids。Mavey Wavey's saying she wants to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wants to leave？What about Johnny？He doesn't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's making the hotel more human-y for Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，seeing that he isn't a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is a monster！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just a late fanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I could be a hand model.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！It's all that human-y stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's confusing poor Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So maybe you gotta get the kid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,around more monster-y things。Ooh！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I need a cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。She's always around，checking up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，if you could just get some alone time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。That's what Johnny wants，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alone time with Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have they even had a vacation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,since before they were married？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're going to now。And so are we。Frank，you're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll take Denisovich to all our old haunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.66,0:24:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Each of us will show him our skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teach him how to be a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.77,0:24:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he'll be fanging it up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy turns five next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.57,0:24:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he's not a vampire by his birthday，it ain't happenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it ain't ain't happening，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,All he needs is time with his vampa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Vampa」？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vampire grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，man。That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny。Come outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Who is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your father-in-law。I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.86,0:25:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get rid of them。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.07,0:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem-o。I was kinda diggin' the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can they stay？I don't think they're ready to leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Go to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，you want to stay here，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.75,0:25:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the first place where I can really be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't felt this alive
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,since they invented stuffed-crust pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then，we've got some work to do。Okay，so here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a good idea to take her to your hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,But remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，it's sliced avocado，rolled oats with apricot，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.73,0:25:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Aveeno moisturizer after every bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And… - Then the shea butter on his tush before his PJs
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.47,0:25:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then 20 minutes with the nebulizer
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,while I read his Learning Factory Phonics book to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's asking a lot，Dad。We could just take Dennis with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Are you kidding me？And get him off his routine？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.25,0:26:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You kids go to California，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,and see if it's the right place to raise Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.79,0:26:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you remember how to video chat？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.63,0:26:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes。With the phone and the buttons and the agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so understanding，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you'll keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.93,0:26:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，Mavey。Stake my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.54,0:26:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna miss him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.51,0:26:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.14,0:26:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell him Mavey Wavey stories every night before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the best。I love you，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.95,0:26:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gonna miss all you guys。You're all my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Love you，Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.42,0:26:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I love you，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.79,0:26:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，remember the plan。Just keep her distracted and happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But not too happy，capisce？- Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.07,0:26:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Operation 「Just Keep Her Distracted and Happy，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「But Not Too Happy，Capisce，」 starts now。Cool？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smiling on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you hug my backpack？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.74,0:26:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.22,0:27:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，yes，we'll get to the bed。We all love the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we're just gonna do one thing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it shorts weather where we're going？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jeez。I hope not。My body isn't swimsuit-ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.20,0:27:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever。Where's Griffin？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，can I have a second？I'm just saying goodbye to Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.21,0:27:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you have to be strong，honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because what we have is unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Babe，don't cry。Everyone's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.62,0:27:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I gotta call him on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just let him play it out，get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，you two lovebirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink your champagne and let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.86,0:27:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。No，sure。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheers，babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。You klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't say nothin' about this？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.73,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。We don't have time for zingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you click in the stupid car seat？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta cut those nails，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just strap our kids down with duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.39,0:28:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.06,0:28:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told him he could come。He's never been outside the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.93,0:28:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blobby，there's no room。Sorry，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.30,0:28:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that ain't happenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine，put him on the Rascal。Let's just get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we going，Papa Drac？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.09,0:28:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Denisovich，we're going to have an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,A monster-y adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yay！Monsters！We're gonna eat cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.73,0:28:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did he say？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.83,0:29:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No cake on this monster trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No cake，cebause Kakie says，「Too much cake makes tummy ache.」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.54,0:29:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「A monster always shares.」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,We may need more than a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.51,0:29:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you know who could fix the kid in a snap？Vlad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.75,0:29:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？We don't need to call Vlad。We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Denisovich，monsters are nice，just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,But when the moon comes out，the real monster fun begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being scary。Right，guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys？Guys！What is wrong with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Everybody likes that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.91,0:29:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not everybody。We're scary monsters。Remember？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what are you putting in？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.05,0:29:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an audio book.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.58,0:29:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bigfoot's life story。He reads it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.75,0:29:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chapter One.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.92,0:30:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is gonna be so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。You're gonna be so happy，but not too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Huh？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.73,0:30:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanna see everything you did growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.06,0:30:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as you're distracted，capisce？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.13,0:30:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can hit a few spots on the way to my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.77,0:30:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lemme just quickly call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.33,0:30:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.07,0:30:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's only 1：00 A.M。there。Dennis isn't even up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.94,0:30:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。I'm just not used to being away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be cool。Your dad was so all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。He's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right turn，here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.80,0:31:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boys，this bringing back any memories？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.94,0:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We used to prowl around here when we were in our 100s.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.28,0:31:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Forest of Slobozia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.99,0:31:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice how they built it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.69,0:31:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.93,0:31:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，you're going to see
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.53,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,every monster do his specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.10,0:31:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，Frank's gonna show us how he scares people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.81,0:31:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yay！He's gonna say，「Boo.」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.64,0:31:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I don't think 「boos」 ever work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.18,0:32:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that's why we're here。To learn from the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.13,0:32:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，guess it just depends on work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.94,0:32:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frankenstein！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.54,0:32:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how ya doin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.67,0:32:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're awesome！Can we take a picture？Is that okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，okay。Little selfie action.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.11,0:32:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,For real？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Awesome！Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.38,0:32:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，have a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.92,0:32:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。He's adorable。He's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Adorable，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.12,0:32:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not scary，but 「boo」 is a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.90,0:33:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,My birthday cake's gonna have the coolest guy on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.74,0:33:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me guess。Kakie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。He's so cool。He climbs walls and wears a cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.01,0:33:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，really。And who is this very cool guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.05,0:33:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batman！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batman。Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know anyone else with a cape that's cool？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.86,0:33:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is good。Stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.13,0:33:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Wayne。It's your turn。Go kill something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.47,0:33:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.97,0:33:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't inspire Denisovich，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.27,0:33:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,how's he going to find his inner monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.31,0:33:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's in a monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.71,0:33:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody，just…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，have an avocado.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.61,0:33:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mommy says it's a good fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever the heaven that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.82,0:33:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I'm not gonna set monsters back again
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.85,0:33:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,just to make your grandkid like vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.42,0:33:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，there's nothing to kill here。It's all been…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.23,0:33:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.67,0:34:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。You know I haven't done this in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need to kill anymore。We have Pop-Tarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.31,0:34:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，you're going to love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.78,0:34:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne's going to eat that whole deer，and the next one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne，go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.52,0:34:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man。I'm too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，how's it go again？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.56,0:34:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，wait。That's for the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I growl。Right，here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Growl！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.83,0:34:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.54,0:34:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it，Uncle Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.41,0:34:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some werewolf。Did you actually say the word 「growl？」
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a werewussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.85,0:34:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said I was rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gimme me that Frisbee.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.58,0:34:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！It's my Frisbee！I fetched it！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.09,0:34:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it to me！Give it back！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.75,0:34:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it over here！Give me that！Give it back！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's fine。He's Blobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.27,0:35:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place is so amazing and scenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.24,0:35:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you wanna show me first？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.47,0:35:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm。I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's pretty，but there's really
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.34,0:35:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,nothing to do once it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.81,0:35:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。What's that place？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.71,0:35:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you're telling me that I can pick
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.98,0:35:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,between all these different kinds of chips？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.39,0:35:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.62,0:35:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do people decide？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.42,0:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now what's that beautiful fountain of rubies？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.43,0:35:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny，have you tried this Slurpee？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that quickly，hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.53,0:35:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It comes in 48 flavors。We have to try them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，I don't know if we have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？This place is open all night。Right，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:35:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny，look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're making a TV show about this place and we're the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.29,0:36:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.76,0:36:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's totally awesome。You're so lucky，Kal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.50,0:36:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Murray。Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse us。Do you know where someone can get a bite around here？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you seriously just ask a vampire where to get a bite？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，gosh。I didn't mean… We're not from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is so embarrassing。Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.62,0:36:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you。Love your chocolate cereal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what do you want me to do now？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.06,0:36:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，you won't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.82,0:36:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The mummy can crash through walls
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and turn into a swarm of beetles
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.16,0:36:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,and put a curse on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That sounds mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's fun mean。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.27,0:36:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Murray's going to conjure up
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.87,0:36:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,the biggest sandstorm you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.87,0:36:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.61,0:36:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sandstorm？It's been awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.34,0:37:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not my problem。Do it。Say your little spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.15,0:37:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got this。Frank，Wayne，Griffin，just try not to faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.97,0:37:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,My back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,How cute！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.57,0:37:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Stop at that playground。Look at these cute kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy rabies！This looks like a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.61,0:38:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Mavey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.05,0:38:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,This can be pretty dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.05,0:38:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.95,0:38:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，I rock these bikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I，little dude？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.89,0:38:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out。Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.56,0:38:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is how I rolled every summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I scratched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.25,0:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavey，I told you，it took me years to get this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.25,0:38:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You feel me now？That's my girlfriend，suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.13,0:39:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your wife，Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wife。Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.30,0:39:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was sick，lady。Where did you learn how to do that stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.43,0:39:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's cool。I have a cousin from Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。These little guys are so sweet。Dennis would love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What an awesome place to raise a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.31,0:39:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。To raise a kid？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.24,0:39:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know about awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.18,0:39:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe tubular。Capisce？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyways，we should hit my folks' place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said we'd be there by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.95,0:39:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，it's after 3：00 o'clock in Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.59,0:40:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check on Dennis，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.50,0:40:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chocolate cereal。Are you kidding me？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.37,0:40:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，Drac。It's 'cause they love us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.57,0:40:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Monsters are what's goin' on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。You should embrace it like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got a best-selling workout video.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.27,0:40:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me，ladies。Right。And left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.98,0:40:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，girls。Watch me。You're not watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.71,0:40:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go。And eight and seven and six…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not me，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,even Bigfoot's tearin' it up in the German soccer league.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.83,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。Oh，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.17,0:40:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.70,0:40:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're pushing too hard。Lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.41,0:40:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich，wake up。Oh，boy，he's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.31,0:40:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what took so long？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.65,0:40:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.02,0:41:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing，Mavey。We're all great here at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.39,0:41:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just doing hotel things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.45,0:41:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，can't handle your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.82,0:41:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.36,0:41:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.89,0:41:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.49,0:41:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just went biking and mini-marting。It's so fun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.30,0:41:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Dennis okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to see him？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Yes，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，baby。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.17,0:41:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.81,0:41:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.48,0:41:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，little dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is he wearing sunglasses？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.88,0:41:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，we were playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.02,0:41:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a superhero thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.85,0:41:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause，I'm Sunglasses Man，to the rescue！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.35,0:41:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，take it down a notch。- I'm flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.02,0:41:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sound funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.63,0:41:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no，that's his Sunglasses Man voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.76,0:41:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Static。The signal is bad。Mavis，are you there？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.00,0:41:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm still…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.14,0:41:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I guess he's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.94,0:41:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.64,0:42:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，I nailed it with the Sunglasses Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right off the top of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.75,0:42:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I threw in a 「cebause.」 Did everyone see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.78,0:42:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said she was having fun。Johnny's blowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.62,0:42:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's biking and mini-marting。She's gonna wanna move！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta fix this kid now。Are we almost there or what？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.82,0:42:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I may
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.79,0:42:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,have taken a wrong turn a few miles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't get mad。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.36,0:42:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone turn on the navigator on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look how light I touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.64,0:42:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please enter your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。I am begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.94,0:42:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，this is gonna be good，Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.48,0:42:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scary stuff，okay？It's in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.42,0:42:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just gotta concentrate on the scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.25,0:42:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa Drac？Do you miss Grandma？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.09,0:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Grandma？Oh。Sure，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.93,0:42:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I miss her every day。She was my zing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.13,0:42:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you ask？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.67,0:42:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.13,0:42:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you miss anybody？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.17,0:43:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I miss Mommy and Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who else？You miss that Winnie？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.17,0:43:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The pup who tackles you and tries to lick you all the time？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.34,0:43:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but we're just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.65,0:43:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no，no。You're a Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't just be friends
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.52,0:43:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a cute，hairy number like Winnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right turn，now！Here。You imbecile！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.06,0:43:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。Turn，Griffin！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.19,0:43:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Papa Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait and see，fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.47,0:43:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This kid'll be guzzling goat blood in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.30,0:43:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have arrived at your destination。Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.74,0:43:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes！- Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the vampire summer camp I went to as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.05,0:43:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's it，Camp Vamp？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.51,0:43:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Who names their camp 「Camp Vamp？」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Camp Winnepacaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.41,0:44:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Denisovich？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.17,0:44:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is where I learned to catch mice and shapeshift.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.31,0:44:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And use my incredible powers and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.31,0:44:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's pretty cool。Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.05,0:44:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Badminton.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.59,0:44:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I don't remember this badminting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.96,0:44:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well，is this a night？How ya doing，folks？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.99,0:44:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Dana，the director.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.86,0:44:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're sure excited to have you legends visitin' us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.40,0:44:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What can I do you for？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.43,0:44:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm very interested in
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.43,0:44:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,sending my grandboy，Denisovich，here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.24,0:44:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。This little redheaded，non-fangy little guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.78,0:44:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，they're in there。He's a late fanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.78,0:44:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.31,0:44:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you show us some of the drills，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,like where they catch the mice？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.65,0:44:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can do。Of course now we call it Tee-Mousing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.67,0:45:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,So they don't have to catch the mice？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope。We find this is a good way to build their confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.47,0:45:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.84,0:45:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's right there！What's the matter with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.38,0:45:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hokey-pokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,There it is，Denisovich。Where Papa learned to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.32,0:45:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh！I wanna fly like Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.03,0:45:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We're over here，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Had to scale it down。Insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.40,0:45:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me。Help me。Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.74,0:45:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hokey-pokey。See ya at the campfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.55,0:46:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，gosh！Welcome，you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.25,0:46:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.49,0:46:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，guys。This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.42,0:46:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Look at all of this。So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.63,0:46:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！I can't believe I'm actually here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.60,0:46:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，how does it work？Are you up all night and sleep all day？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.33,0:46:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。I'll do whatever you guys want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.00,0:46:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 'Cause I bought this pretty sunhat for you。- Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But otherwise this poncho，if you wanna be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.64,0:46:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can deal with it later，Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.48,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Come see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.31,0:46:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've set up your bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.99,0:46:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just like Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.19,0:46:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Transylvania。That was a fun experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.73,0:46:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mike was afraid he'd get disemboweled and eaten，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.86,0:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I told him he was just being silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.86,0:46:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was you，Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.87,0:46:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.83,0:46:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，we have a couple of
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.83,0:46:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,mixed families in the neighborhood，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd invite them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.64,0:46:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They might be nice for you guys to talk to
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.74,0:46:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,since you're thinkin' about moving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.21,0:47:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Caren。Hi，Pandragora.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.41,0:47:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Welcome，Mavis。- Hey，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.48,0:47:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you're gonna dig it here。Don't even worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.79,0:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,People are totally cool with our lifestyle choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.19,0:47:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，the kids get picked on a little，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.56,0:47:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it toughens them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.83,0:47:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，you guys。And this is Loretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.66,0:47:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's married to Paul，who's a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.70,0:47:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.37,0:47:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I was telling Mavis
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.97,0:47:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,about the other monster-human couples in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.87,0:47:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.77,0:47:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.44,0:47:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you're welcome to stay and have some cupcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Vampires will be friends forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.82,0:47:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Through the centuries together ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.02,0:47:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Even in the brightest sunny weather ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.29,0:47:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Vampires will be friends forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.50,0:47:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Literally ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.10,0:48:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great job，vampires。Give yourselves a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.12,0:48:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Where？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.59,0:48:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are we doing this？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.09,0:48:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd rather be listening to those putrid new songs？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.96,0:48:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to Michael Row Your Corpse Ashore？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.07,0:48:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or Old McWerewolf Had An Axe？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.04,0:48:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be up here，Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.94,0:48:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's ready to fly？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.01,0:48:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me！Me！Like a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.28,0:48:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better！Like a vampire！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.02,0:48:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing is rickety.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.98,0:48:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？Maybe the kid isn't supposed to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.35,0:48:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet。This is how they learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.75,0:48:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You throw them and they figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.59,0:48:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's how I was taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.23,0:48:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanna fly now！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:49:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attabat。You know Papa's right here if you need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.06,0:49:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh。I can't watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.57,0:49:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.13,0:49:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.94,0:49:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's still not flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.28,0:49:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.61,0:49:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.15,0:49:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a tall tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.75,0:49:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.29,0:49:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.62,0:49:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna fall to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.76,0:49:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's taking his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.09,0:49:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.66,0:49:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did that my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.63,0:49:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's getting too close to the ground！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.63,0:49:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？He's not gonna fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.68,0:49:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you。Papa's always here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.75,0:49:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again！Again！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.08,0:49:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dear。Oh，my devil。We're gonna have to report this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.82,0:49:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean to the papers？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.45,0:49:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it was pretty cool，but I'm not about getting press.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir。I mean the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.43,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't not report child endangerment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Listen to me。That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.76,0:50:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your singing is child endangerment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.20,0:50:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should we go down and help him？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.27,0:50:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope。I told him this was nuts。He's on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to call the boy's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.74,0:50:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，that ain't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.34,0:50:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,His mother's already nutsy koo koo！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.98,0:50:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to follow protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.65,0:50:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will not follow protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.28,0:50:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a vampire。I can't be hypnotized.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.02,0:50:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.29,0:50:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，please。Don't make me call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.86,0:50:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one's calling nobody！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.63,0:50:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.26,0:50:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，drop and roll。Stop，drop and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.13,0:50:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Screaming's not helping！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.14,0:50:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we bad guys，Papa Drac？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.58,0:50:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.38,0:51:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。You're the best kid in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.22,0:51:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't start the fire。It was the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.62,0:51:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a very unsafe tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.22,0:51:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lucky we don't call the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.16,0:51:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.03,0:51:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause I'm Batman！To the Batmobile！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。To the…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.81,0:51:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about all that stuff。I guess they thought you'd like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.51,0:51:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so weird here？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.68,0:51:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，hon。They're being weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.88,0:51:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think they're just trying to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.35,0:51:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I grew up knowing nothing living inside that hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.89,0:51:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you learned about everything growing up in Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.89,0:51:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Santa Cruz。But，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.43,0:51:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe if Dennis grows up away from Transylvania，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,he won't be so freaky。Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.30,0:51:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you nuts？Mavis，you're a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.84,0:51:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're so full of life and curious about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.74,0:52:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Dennis grows up to be just like you，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.04,0:52:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be the luckiest dad in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.21,0:52:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Johnnystein.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.35,0:52:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.75,0:52:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as we're all together，we'll be happy anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.72,0:52:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.36,0:52:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.43,0:52:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.83,0:52:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check out this video my friend sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.36,0:52:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This kid is an awesome daredevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.67,0:52:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dude！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.64,0:52:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get it？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.77,0:52:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Is that Dennis？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.07,0:52:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Is it？No。It's just hard to see。But…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.84,0:52:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oops。Just deleted it。So，it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.92,0:52:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？It's Mavis。I'm not answering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.03,0:52:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Drac。You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.33,0:52:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，honeybunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.90,0:53:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.57,0:53:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… we're outside the hotel having a little cookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.61,0:53:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.31,0:53:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that noise？Is that a siren？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，those are just some wailing banshees checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.15,0:53:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet，you banshees.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.02,0:53:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're trying to have a perfectly safe cookout over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy！I wanna say hi！Mommy！Mommy！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa Drac just tried to teach me how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.99,0:53:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。Is that the mother？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。Static again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.20,0:53:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am coming back to the hotel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you better be there or I swear，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.40,0:53:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，you're gonna be very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.10,0:53:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.14,0:53:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to get home right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.84,0:53:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'll go wake up my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.54,0:53:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，we gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.15,0:53:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got no car！How we gonna get out of here？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。I made a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Blobby。We really meant to call you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.10,0:54:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.65,0:54:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.82,0:54:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to go where？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.22,0:54:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transylvania。As soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.66,0:54:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't fly direct to Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.16,0:54:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can go to Bucharest，but you'll have to
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.43,0:54:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,switch planes in Chicago and then Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.33,0:54:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，when would we get there？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.07,0:54:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，the Chicago flight's delayed due to bad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，two seats in coach？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.21,0:54:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to go now？When we finally have no traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.80,0:55:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're killing me，Blobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.41,0:55:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still have some cloud on me。Gotta do a selfie！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.48,0:55:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny！Not now！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.05,0:55:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.63,0:55:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,This scooter thing's out of juice。We're never gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.16,0:55:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.03,0:56:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,How fun is this？Why are you laughing？You like that？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.30,0:56:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.37,0:56:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coochie-coochie-coochie-coo！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.45,0:56:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now this is flying，Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.31,0:56:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my boy。Look at you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the coolest guy who wears a cape，Papa Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.93,0:57:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，hey，when are you going to get here already？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.70,0:57:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been waiting…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.34,0:57:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.54,0:57:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just went out for some avocados.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.98,0:57:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy！I flew！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.51,0:57:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.21,0:57:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Mother's already nutsy koo koo ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.21,0:57:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Nutsy koo koo ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.85,0:57:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Koo koo Oh，dear。Oh，dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.65,0:57:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Oh，my devil I have to follow protocol ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.42,0:57:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ That ain't happening That ain't happening ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.22,0:57:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Mother's already ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.69,0:57:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Koo koo ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.79,0:57:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Koo koo ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.77,0:58:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was worried Dennis wasn't safe around other monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.20,0:58:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I don't even feel like he's safe around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.51,0:58:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was it you said？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.94,0:58:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Human，monster，unicorn。That it didn't matter？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.41,0:58:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I just know his life would…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.62,0:58:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have his birthday party here on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.08,0:58:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.05,0:58:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，Mavey。Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.96,0:58:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you've let humans into your hotel，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.16,0:58:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I don't think you've let them into your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.94,0:59:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can do it。I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.18,0:59:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat。I'm a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a bat。I'm a bat。I'm a bat！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.55,0:59:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis？What are you doing，sweetie？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.52,0:59:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful。Let me help you down from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.59,0:59:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you getting excited about your big party？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.76,0:59:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.63,0:59:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who's coming？Daddy's whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.63,0:59:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grandpa Mike and Grandma Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.93,0:59:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,All your cousins and aunts and uncles who love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.74,0:59:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then they're gonna be with us when we move to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.81,0:59:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy，are we going away because I'm not a monster？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.44,0:59:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No。Dennis，of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.05,0:59:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just grown-up stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.65,0:59:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。But what about Papa Drac？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.29,0:59:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna be here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.89,1:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa Drac has to stay here to run the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he'll visit us。And we'll visit him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.46,1:00:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we call him every night？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.06,1:00:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.27,1:00:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Awesome！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.97,1:00:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.01,1:00:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ The night brings Johnny's family here ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.48,1:00:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ To take away all that Drac holds dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.19,1:00:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.32,1:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Hide your feelings ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.59,1:00:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Keep them all inside ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.37,1:00:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dude，why do you wanna leave？This place is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.17,1:00:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.54,1:00:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,All these awesome freakazoids！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.64,1:00:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，who's the coolest monster？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.14,1:00:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.41,1:00:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie。What a wussbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.68,1:01:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't it nice to have the whole family together？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.22,1:01:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis，do you have any cousins or thingies in your family？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.32,1:01:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's just been me and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.52,1:01:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never did ask how you lost your mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.23,1:01:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。She was killed by angry humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.53,1:01:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Awkward ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.43,1:01:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there is my Grandpa Vlad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.77,1:01:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you have a grandpa？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。He'll be at the party。I invited him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.44,1:01:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You invited him？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.54,1:01:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，he's never seen Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted them to meet once before we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.41,1:01:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Great。Peachy。Good old Vlad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.75,1:01:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anybody have a wet wipe？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.57,1:01:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy rabies。He finally invites me to something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.94,1:01:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got a grandkid？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.44,1:02:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he never told you？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.28,1:02:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy，Bela。At least there's another vampire in the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.68,1:02:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's at a hotel？Fancy schmancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hotels are for humans！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.66,1:02:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bela，shut your blood hole。Look what you started.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.36,1:02:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.36,1:02:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I raised my son to hate and kill and steal the souls of humans
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.70,1:02:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,like a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.84,1:02:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Grandpa Vlad will be so happy when he sees
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.17,1:02:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,the big masquerade party Johnny and I have planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.58,1:02:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.25,1:02:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Play along。It's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.95,1:02:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a dad？That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.78,1:02:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。My dad cannot know you're a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.25,1:02:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or any of your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.52,1:02:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？But，Drac，I'm proud that we're…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.03,1:02:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or he'll steal your family's souls and eat your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.33,1:02:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna make the birthday a monster masquerade party.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.84,1:03:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Oh，that's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.14,1:03:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sort of like a last hurrah
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,before Dennis gets to be with normal people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.68,1:03:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't have said it better.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.40,1:03:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think，Mavis？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'm starting to like being creepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.14,1:03:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lucky we don't call the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.74,1:03:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，my hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.71,1:03:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I'm Batman！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.41,1:03:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！To the Batmobile！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.46,1:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got your butt kicked by a girl，Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.96,1:03:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Whatever。I'm not about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.10,1:04:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hotel Transylvania.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.47,1:04:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell humans！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.01,1:04:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tear it down！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.04,1:04:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bela，we're in the outside world。You're gonna smell humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.65,1:04:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？Just wait outside for me。This is family stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.25,1:04:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.92,1:04:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanna meet the little fanger.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.79,1:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,He should know his great-vampa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.32,1:04:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,His what？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.06,1:04:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vampire grandpa。Come on。That was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.83,1:04:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amazing party！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.53,1:04:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.43,1:04:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your vampire costume？What are you，nuts？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ordered it online.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.54,1:04:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the only place that delivered overnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.51,1:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look like you got a baboon's butt on your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.98,1:04:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you at least practiced your voice？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.98,1:04:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't just talk like a hippie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.05,1:04:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a hippie。I'm a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.75,1:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk like a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.18,1:05:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Count Jonafang。I am a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.76,1:05:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，vampires don't go around saying，「I am a vampire.」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.46,1:05:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I am Count Jonafang。Bleh，bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.90,1:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.90,1:05:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，listen，if you think I don't like it，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,you definitely don't want to say，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.07,1:05:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Bleh，bleh-bleh，」 in front of my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.91,1:05:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，Master Kakie has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.21,1:05:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac，this is Brandon，a.k.a。Kakie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.18,1:05:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We got him for Dennis。- Hey，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.25,1:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nauseated to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.32,1:05:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,When does this happen？I got a book fair in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.52,1:05:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Where's my vampson？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.63,1:05:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please。Still has to make a dramatic entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！Look at you！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you run a hotel now？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.00,1:05:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,From Prince of Darkness to King of Room Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.84,1:05:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。So good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.98,1:05:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.05,1:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep Vlad away from the humans and Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.89,1:06:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.89,1:06:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，now that is a neat costume.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.43,1:06:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,These two smell funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.96,1:06:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you're European.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.63,1:06:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's called deodorant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.27,1:06:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing like insulting an entire continent，Linda.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.37,1:06:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Count！How goes it？Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.51,1:06:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I'm technically Frankenstein's monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.74,1:06:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frankenstein，he's the doctor who…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would love to hear more。Call my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.65,1:06:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，let me introduce you to some of your son's other buddies.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.92,1:06:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Murray.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.68,1:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.42,1:06:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，yo，V！What's up？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.29,1:06:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talking toilet paper。Well，that's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.46,1:06:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Where's the kid？That's who I wanna meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.80,1:06:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.93,1:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Dracula's son-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.87,1:06:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Count Jonafang.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.77,1:06:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh，bleh，black sheep.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.24,1:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you any wool？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.28,1:07:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that thing on your head？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.18,1:07:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like my grandmother's boobies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.22,1:07:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy，who's the man with the funny face？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.35,1:07:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this the kid？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.62,1:07:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.86,1:07:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see those fangs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.56,1:07:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.86,1:07:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I just love him so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.76,1:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to hug him right in the fangs that he has.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.00,1:07:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I repeat，let me see those fangs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.98,1:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's a late fanger，just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.15,1:07:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Yes。Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.62,1:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The big shot here was a little crybaby，all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.39,1:07:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes，I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.72,1:07:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Used to pee in his bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.89,1:07:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.43,1:07:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just need to scare the fangs out of the kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hare ha hangs？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.00,1:07:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's what I did for Mr。Tough Guy here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.73,1:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，you've got to possess something
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.30,1:08:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,the late fanger finds sweet and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you show them what's what and…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.47,1:08:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pop！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.54,1:08:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me。It'll scare the fangs right out。Right，Drac？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.71,1:08:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，guys，if I'm late for the book fair，
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll miss the street fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.95,1:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's your guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.35,1:08:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Possessed？But Dennis will be so upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.22,1:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you get it？This is our ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.39,1:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it works for Denisovich，boom！He's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.26,1:08:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you all get to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.16,1:08:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.87,1:08:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Capisce。- Good call.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.87,1:08:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kids，everyone，have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.97,1:08:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis has a big surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.47,1:08:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one and only Kakie，The Cake Monster！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kids！It's me，Kakie！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.88,1:08:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a wonderful Kakie day it is！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.29,1:08:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I have a question。Who here loves cake？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.63,1:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rise！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.07,1:09:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why am I floating？Can I have the stage manager，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.84,1:09:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't working for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.25,1:09:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scary，Denisovich？You feeling anything？Any change？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.42,1:09:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Kakie okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.22,1:09:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want all the cake。Sharing is for cowards.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.03,1:09:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't remember any of this from the TV show.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.50,1:09:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… I think I saw it on a Blu-Ray disc，bonus stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.40,1:09:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，why is Grandpa Vlad up there？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.98,1:09:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm scared，Papa。What's happening to Kakie？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.22,1:09:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't eat cake。Cake eat you！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.69,1:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.19,1:10:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.69,1:10:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,What just happened，man？I'm outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of these parents better review this on Yelp.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.10,1:10:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what did you just do？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.97,1:10:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,A few more seconds
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.97,1:10:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the kid's fangs would have popped right out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.51,1:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care。It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.11,1:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's not worth it？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.14,1:10:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was my last attempt to make the boy a vampire，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.74,1:10:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,so you'd stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.61,1:10:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,By ruining his favorite thing？How could you do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.78,1:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were in on this？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.72,1:10:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis won't be happy in my town.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.22,1:10:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis hasn't been there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.06,1:10:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Now husband and wife ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.39,1:10:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Feel the strain and the strife ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.49,1:10:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.26,1:10:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny，Dennis is not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.90,1:10:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,He likes avocado.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause you don't let him eat anything fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.67,1:10:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think Dennis just wants to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.90,1:10:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we stop using the word 「normal」？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.31,1:10:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where we live now，he's normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.64,1:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is who he is。And you can't change him，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.38,1:11:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis，where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.88,1:11:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Away.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.02,1:11:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's not safe out here by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.46,1:11:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know a place where we can hide。Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.87,1:11:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you didn't stop me，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.40,1:11:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,my great-grandson wouldn't have to be a wimp his whole life
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.57,1:11:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,like Schlumpy over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.24,1:11:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A wimp？- Johnny，be cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.17,1:11:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna throw down，old man？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.31,1:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certified yellow belt since 1997.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.01,1:11:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.25,1:11:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this now？You're not a vampire？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.42,1:11:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bleh？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.99,1:11:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course he's human。He's our son。You think we're monsters？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.69,1:11:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！You let your daughter marry a human and have a human kid？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.56,1:11:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just put a stake through my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.80,1:11:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't hate humans anymore，and they don't hate us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.71,1:12:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Humans？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.04,1:12:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.51,1:12:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your great-grandson is the sweetest，kindest，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.25,1:12:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,most special boy I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.08,1:12:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you can't give him the love
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.22,1:12:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,he deserves because he's half-human，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.99,1:12:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,then you're the fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.86,1:12:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.19,1:12:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where is Dennis？Dennis！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.86,1:12:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.20,1:12:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy birthday，Dennis。I made you a treat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.24,1:12:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dead pigeon？- Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause once I graduate business school
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.21,1:12:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,and start running a company，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.34,1:12:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're not gonna get home-cooked meals like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to move away，Winnie。To California.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.72,1:12:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mommy thinks I'm not happy here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.55,1:12:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,cebause I don't have hair on my face like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.09,1:12:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.56,1:12:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you are perfect。You're the nicest boy I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I have 300 brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.03,1:12:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're nice，too，Winnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.37,1:13:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well，well。The little human and his pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.77,1:13:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dennis！- Denisovich！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.64,1:13:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not in the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.91,1:13:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not by the pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not in this pot of soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could he be？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.18,1:13:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why I ever invited you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.15,1:13:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！Dennis！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.75,1:13:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.79,1:13:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.20,1:13:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop squirming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.07,1:13:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.14,1:13:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because this is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.17,1:13:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why doesn't anybody get that？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Humans don't belong with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.75,1:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're wrong！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.58,1:13:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am holding you hostage.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.49,1:13:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And me and my crew are gonna
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.49,1:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,tear that human-hugging hotel to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.72,1:13:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.29,1:13:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Why not？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.03,1:14:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.30,1:14:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause，why？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.36,1:14:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause it will make Papa Drac sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.60,1:14:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh… Sad。And what are you gonna do about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.44,1:14:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.51,1:14:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know why you don't know？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.54,1:14:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cebause you're just a weak little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.18,1:14:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.75,1:14:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis，we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.02,1:14:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay，Winnie？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.75,1:14:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，my zing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.55,1:15:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！There he is，right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.72,1:15:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis！Baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.22,1:15:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,My big boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.83,1:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis，we were lookin' for ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.03,1:15:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.39,1:15:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.10,1:15:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's his mean friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.27,1:15:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh… This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.27,1:16:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.32,1:17:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You rock，Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.89,1:17:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,He means Denisovich.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.05,1:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kakie rules！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.07,1:17:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis，I'm coming。Whoa…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.91,1:17:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew all that practice would pay off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.96,1:17:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，you better fly away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.87,1:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa Drac，I'm a vampire and a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.47,1:18:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I cool now？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.41,1:18:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Now」？Dennis，you were always cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.98,1:18:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Human，vampire，unicorn，you're perfect no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.75,1:18:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But since I'm a vampire，can we stay here？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.92,1:18:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.19,1:18:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.42,1:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.83,1:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you have to know，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.83,1:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're going to visit you here every holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.96,1:18:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's fine。- That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.75,1:18:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever come near me or my family again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.19,1:18:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.53,1:19:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy，you just saved a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.54,1:19:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,All this pressure about
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.94,1:19:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,when the boy's fangs were coming out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who cares？Mine came out years ago！Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Dad，put 'em back in before we all barf.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.78,1:19:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Isn't it still somebody's birthday？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.54,1:20:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me hear you sing！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.18,1:20:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:10.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,《精灵旅社2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:44.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（梅菲斯和乔纳森 新婚快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎！欢迎！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 德古
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 大家都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克伦夫妇 新郎的父母 携家人出席
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 妈妈！- 约翰尼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你们都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女伴火不火辣？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,火辣爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女伴呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了女伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她隐身了 所以你们看不见她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 从「加拿大」来的那位？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的太好了 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切你满意吗 我的小毒果？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过瓦拉德爷爷在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你爷爷可不会接受这场婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很守旧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道他接受不了？如果他能见见约翰尼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会吃了他的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:05:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你的时髦老爸比还是不够开明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老爸你能接受他只是一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他是人 怪物 还是独角兽 只要你幸福就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你永远是我皎洁的月光 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今你乘爱的翅膀翱翔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你已成为约翰尼的妻子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 约翰尼的妻子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也是爸爸的乖乖女 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你妈妈肯定会很高兴 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为她一直明白 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱是在为你们的完美铺路 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年以后）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,托德 休息下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲斯想问你要不要出去兜兜风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好久没兜风了 有什么特别的原因吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 梅菲？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打的什么主意？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在犯傻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚夜色很好啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 如果你不想…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！你在开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能和你出去飞一圈 让我吃一桶大蒜都行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 看那些松软的云团
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得小时候你和我一起玩的游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,利器捉迷藏？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 正常的捉迷藏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会抓到你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝？你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 只是我怀孕了以后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就经常喘不上气来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 我想那样确实会…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当外公了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当爸爸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是爸爸的女儿 还是儿子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 女儿 还是儿子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我又饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我去弄点凤尾鱼冰激凌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你可不能随便吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对宝宝不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要多吃点蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他才能爬上天花板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多喝点羊胆汁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸 可是我们还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝会不会是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果宝宝和约翰尼一样是普通人 我会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「普通人」 宝宝可有着千年的德古拉基因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不可能是普通人的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要宝宝健康就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 健康的小吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一个能像蝙蝠一样飞翔的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点怪物球汤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你妈妈的食谱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小时候你给我做的一样 我最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（产房）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 只有孩子的生父才能进入产房
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我是说 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算是家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看！是个男孩！男孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古拉的血脉得以延续了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有我在 没人能伤害你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小魔孙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我能抱抱孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你爸 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是弗朗辛护士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯现在一岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 萌娃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 礼物时间到 伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让这小子大吃一惊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我送的 超闪吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,受过诅咒的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级受诅咒的 我只送最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,古墓直邮的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才刚会走路 那链子是不是有点重…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事的 丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是丹尼斯 取的是我父亲的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是他的吸血鬼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小丹尼索维奇-维索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他就是个吸血鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是说那是什么坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是难道他不应该有和你们一样的尖牙和苍白肤色吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上 你得等到五岁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会长出吸血鬼尖牙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 他会长的 他可是德古拉家的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也有一半的洛克伦血统
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他去我们那里生活会更好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的人类更多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？看看他和小狼崽们玩得多开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也准备了礼物 希望你能收下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我的第一个断头台」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有教育意义 送得好 弗兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 谢谢 不过我们要加点儿童防护
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 你把橡胶防护放哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给断头台加装儿童防护？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大不了把手指切了 也是这游戏的乐趣所在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我给整个旅社都装了儿童防护
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人保护欲太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼！快来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？他没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯刚说了第一个词！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来 宝贝 再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉巴拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说 「巴拉 巴拉巴拉」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没说这是你教的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他从哪里学的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉巴拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你这么说过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是形容我不会说这个的时候才会说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉巴拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 小屁孩 我们知道你会说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有蛀牙而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉巴拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉巴拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你教的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真丑成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真没法和你一起玩耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 搞什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开派对啊？快接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管约翰尼有没有说过这是个「酷应用」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里还是个新人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 浆糊脑袋 你有给格姆林伯格订灵车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有 你又在看脸书主页了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古 我和大家说了社交媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是宣传旅社的最佳方式
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 克利夫顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古 作为你新上任的人类关系公关助手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些想法要和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这确实是一份真实的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是用来哄梅菲斯开心 好让你永远待在这里的烂借口
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我的想法是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们有了很多人类房客 也许我们应该更新某些表演的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 请个人类魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三眼哈利哪里不好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人类来说 他有点老派了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 先生 你的牌是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃三？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的牌吗 朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 哈利很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众跟不上潮流不能怪哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那韦恩呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩？你疯了吗？他是我铁哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那除了网球 让他干点别的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你要做的是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,击球瞬间向上挥动球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能打出漂亮的上旋球
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,打一个试试
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？这是什么声音？这声音出在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我给你买的手机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克利夫顿给你发了短信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学着怎么回短信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼… 完全没反应
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的德古 嘎嘎啦呢嘎啦嘎啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以给他回短信了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么弄啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你的指甲太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 你看 我来给梅菲斯发短信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会之夜望眼欲穿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单吧？看 她回我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,得取消了 不能丢下丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道再也不能独处了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也需要你的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,发送
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我唯一看出的就是你很可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许你该弄个蓝牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 蓝牙 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳晒屁股了 我的丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 外公
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 我的小恶魔 昨晚做了美美的噩梦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我梦见我看到一只剑龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝了它的血吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是问问而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想做点很酷的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要教你怎么变成一只蝙蝠 像我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗？- 酷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！很酷 就像我说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来试试
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是只蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是只蝙蝠 我是只蝙蝠 我是只蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是只蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一只真正的蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是只蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 深吸口气 你就真的可以变成一只蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看 想象蝙蝠的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？机械舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我给你秀下我的舞步 你会试着飞飞看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？你们为什么在跳舞啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在梦游跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 宝贝 回去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「回去睡觉」？已经过了晚上八点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记新的睡眠时间计划表了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去上人类的班级上半天课
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果今晚他能睡到半夜两点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对他最好不过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 宝贝 韦恩的六只狼宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚要开生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不希望他错过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我很爱狼宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它们对丹尼斯有点太粗野了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「太粗野了」？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没注意到吗？丹尼斯有些与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？丹尼索维奇不该待在怪物身边？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱怪物！电影！电影！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想给德古外公看你的怪物电影吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是最酷的怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂是一只快乐的怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂喜欢蛋糕！真好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚肚疼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么能叫做怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点蛋糕吧 维兹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 孩子们 真正的怪物总是懂得分享
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「分享」？对！我一想到怪物 就会想到「分享」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我来告诉你什么才是真正的怪物吧 丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 拜托 他已经五岁了 别强迫他了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点吃 维兹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一闪 一闪 亮晶晶 满天都是 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我已经长大了 不听摇篮曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不应该是那样唱的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人都是这么唱的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「大多数人」？那这样呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 忍受 忍受 尖叫与痛苦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 血从你脑中喷出 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 拜托 你知道我是怎么对你唱的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 丧尸如李子般将你啃光 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尖厉地哭吧你只有投降 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 忍受 忍受 尖叫与痛苦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你再也不能喘气了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,照样有用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:37.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 沃利 威尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌碧 韦伦 威皮 还有 万耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇！我的乖孩子！你来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑了一下你说的话 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我确实对他有点过于保护了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我的棺材蛋糕宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！我爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 温妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很爱吃你美味的草莓锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,温妮 别那么黏着他 亲爱的 我很抱歉 梅菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 旺达阿姨 他们只是在玩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天狗啊！地狱边境？我以前很喜欢那个游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去玩吧 梅菲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？但是我现在是个母亲了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们展示一下怎么玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧！彩糖罐？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲斯 亲爱的 等一会才能砸那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想这些宝宝们摄入过多的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖分
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 是我挑起的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 它们不是平白无故被叫做一窝幼崽的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.87,0:21:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了一颗糖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊！你的牙掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？他的牙被磕掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 尖牙就要长出来咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他的小奶牙才不是尖牙呢 为什么这颗牙会是尖牙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不是一只怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快出来了 我们得带他上课去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里的课程有什么问题吗？比如说儿童瑜伽？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑜伽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是丹尼索维奇的家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在讨论搬到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.81,0:22:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个对于丹尼斯更加安全的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许约翰尼在加州长大的地方就不错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 但是你不能硬把某人变成他不属于的种类
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 宝贝 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲 等等 你不是说真的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也同意了？搬家的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不确定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还只是说说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们去实施之前 那都不能叫绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是用鸟食把我裹起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他把我裹起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.73,0:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 那不是一颗尖牙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我不知道这对于丹尼斯来说是不是一个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧 约翰尼？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:23:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 不是我说的 都是梅菲的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我什么话都不敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我是个老兄！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古？你在跟谁说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲人勿扰 伯爵正在这里发疯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发什么疯呢 德古？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为孩子们 雪雁梅菲说她想离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想离开？那约翰尼呢？他不想走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了丹尼斯正在把旅社变得更加人性化
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他不是一只怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是只怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是尖牙长得晚而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以当个手模
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！都是那套人类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让可怜的丹尼索维奇感到很困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以也许你得让孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,多接触一些怪物的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一件斗篷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 她一直在身边 盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要能跟他多独处一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 约翰尼也想这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想多与梅菲斯独处一会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们结婚之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,度过假吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们马上就要去度假了 我们也是 弗兰克 你真是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把丹尼索维奇带到我们的老宅子去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.66,0:24:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每个人都教他各自的技能
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,教他如何变成一个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.77,0:24:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就会长出尖牙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子下周就五岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.57,0:24:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他到生日之前还变不成吸血鬼 他就再也不会成为吸血鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要的仅仅是与他吸公相处的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「吸公」？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼外公
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这都听不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 出来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的岳父 我有话对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.86,0:25:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就把它们赶走 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.07,0:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系哟 我有点喜欢这种被关注感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让它们待在这里吗？我觉得它们现在还离不开这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 去找你们妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你想待在这里对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.75,0:25:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一个我可以真正做回自己的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,酥边匹萨问世之后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就再没有感到如此鲜活了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们就有些事情要做了 计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能把她带到你的故乡是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是记住…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃牛油果片 杏肉燕麦卷
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.73,0:25:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次沐浴后要用阿维诺保湿霜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有… - 给他穿睡衣前在他犬齿上抹酪脂油
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.47,0:25:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是给他读知识工厂有声小说时
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他喷雾二十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很麻烦的 爸爸 我们带着丹尼斯就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你在开玩笑吗？要打乱他的日常生活节奏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.25,0:26:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们你们去加州
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那里适不适合养育丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.79,0:26:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得如何视频聊天吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.63,0:26:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 痛苦地用那个按钮和电话聊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你这么善解人意 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会保证他的安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.93,0:26:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 梅菲 我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.54,0:26:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很想他的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.51,0:26:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 妈咪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.14,0:26:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天晚上睡前都会给他讲雪雁梅菲的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太好了 我爱你 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.95,0:26:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你们大家的 你们都是我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 德古
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.42,0:26:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.79,0:26:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我们的计划 只要引开她的注意力 让她开开心心的就好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但也别太开心了 明白吗？- 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.07,0:26:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 「引开她的注意力 让她开开心心」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「但也别太开心了 明白吗」 现在开始 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会拥抱我的背包吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.74,0:26:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉觉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.22,0:27:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们会去睡觉觉 我们都爱睡觉觉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们要先做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去的地方现在是穿短裤的天气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 但愿不是 我的身体还没做好穿泳装的准备呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.20,0:27:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 格里芬呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能等我一会吗？我正跟艾米丽道别呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会特别想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.21,0:27:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 你必须坚强 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们的感情是坚不可摧的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别哭嘛 大伙儿都看着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.62,0:27:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我必须让他摊牌
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他演吧 赶紧演完算了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们两个小恋人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝完香槟我们就要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.86,0:27:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你笨手笨脚的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们啥也不许说？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.73,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没时间跟他斗嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这破安全带怎么系啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该剪指甲了 哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一般用胶带把孩子们绑好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.39,0:28:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.06,0:28:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我说他可以来的 他从没出过旅社一步
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.93,0:28:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗比 没地方了 不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.30,0:28:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是没想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让他骑小摩托 赶紧出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里啊 德古外公
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.09,0:28:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 我们要去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物！我们要吃蛋糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.73,0:28:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.83,0:29:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这次怪物之旅没有蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有蛋糕 应为凯蒂说 「蛋糕吃多了肚子疼」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.54,0:29:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「怪物就要分享」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个星期可能不够啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.51,0:29:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁能轻松治好这个孩子吗？瓦拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.75,0:29:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不需要叫瓦拉德 我们能行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看啊 丹尼索维奇 怪物们很友好 就跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当月亮出来后 真正的怪物派对才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖得很 对吧 各位？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位？你们！你们有毛病吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 所有人都喜欢这首歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.91,0:29:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不是一般人 我们是可怕的怪物 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要播放什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.05,0:29:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是本有声书
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.58,0:29:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脚怪的一生 他亲自口述的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.75,0:29:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一章
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.92,0:30:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次旅行一定会很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你会很开心的 但也不能太过开心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.73,0:30:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看你从小到大做过的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.06,0:30:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能分散你注意力就行 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.13,0:30:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在去我父母家的路上可以停几个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.77,0:30:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先给家里打个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.33,0:30:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.07,0:30:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里才凌晨一点 丹尼斯还没醒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.94,0:30:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦 我就是不太习惯跟他分开
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的 一切都有你爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.78,0:30:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里右转
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.80,0:31:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 起来嗨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位 对这里还有印象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.94,0:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一百多岁的时候经常在这里玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.28,0:31:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯洛博齐亚的黑暗森林
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:40.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑暗森林市政公园 自行车道）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.99,0:31:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看现在这社区多和谐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.69,0:31:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下车
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.93,0:31:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 你会看到
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.53,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物们各施其才
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.10,0:31:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 弗兰克将表演如何恐吓人类
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.81,0:31:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会说 「嘭」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.64,0:31:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「嘭」根本吓不到人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.18,0:32:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这就是我们来的原因 向大师学习
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我可以试试
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.13,0:32:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是要努力才行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.94,0:32:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.54,0:32:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.67,0:32:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太酷了！我们能合影吗？可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 来个小自拍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.11,0:32:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.38,0:32:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们今天愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.92,0:32:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好可爱 他好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.12,0:32:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可怕 但「嘭」也算个开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.90,0:33:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生日蛋糕要放最帅的人在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.74,0:33:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜啊 凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个人非常酷 他会爬墙还穿着披风
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.01,0:33:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的哦 那这个非常帅的人是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.05,0:33:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不认识其他穿披风的帅哥吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.86,0:33:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好 停车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.13,0:33:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 韦恩 该你了 开杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.47,0:33:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.97,0:33:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过的 快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不启发丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.27,0:33:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么发现内心的怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.31,0:33:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在怪物里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.71,0:33:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没谁 就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 吃个牛油果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.61,0:33:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈说它是很好的脂质来源
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道说的是啥
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.82,0:33:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不会再变成怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.85,0:33:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了让你孙子喜欢吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.42,0:33:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 这里没什么活物啊 都已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.23,0:33:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱吖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你得去杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.67,0:34:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 你知道我多年不杀生了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不需要杀戮了 我们有果馅饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.31,0:34:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 你肯定会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.78,0:34:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩要吞下那整头鹿 下一个交给你来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩 上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.52,0:34:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我都一把老骨头了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怎么做的来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.56,0:34:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 月亮出来的时候才要这么叫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该咆哮 好的 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.83,0:34:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡回来 乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.54,0:34:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快抢啊 韦恩叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.41,0:34:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个狼人 你还真把「咆哮」说出来了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个狼鳖才对
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.85,0:34:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都说宝刀已老了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把飞盘给我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.58,0:34:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！这是我的飞盘！我接到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.09,0:34:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我！给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.75,0:34:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来！松口！松口！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事的 他可是布罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.27,0:35:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方好棒好美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.24,0:35:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.47,0:35:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是很漂亮 但天黑后
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.34,0:35:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就真没什么好做的了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.81,0:35:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 那是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.71,0:35:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我可以在这么多种
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.98,0:35:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,薯片里随便选？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.39,0:35:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.62,0:35:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么做决定啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.42,0:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那漂亮的红宝石喷泉又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.43,0:35:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 你喝过这个思乐冰吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太急 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.53,0:35:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有四十八种口味 我们都试一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能时间不够
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？这地方整夜都开 对吧 先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:35:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在录这个地方的节目 录的就是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 世界
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.29,0:36:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.76,0:36:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 你真是太幸运了 卡尔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 世界
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.50,0:36:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 墨瑞 该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你知道附近哪里有吃东西的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的在问一个吸血鬼哪里有吃东西（意同「被咬一口」）的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我不是那个意思… 我们不是本地人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太丢人了 开你的车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.62,0:36:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了啊 特别喜欢你代言的巧克力麦片
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在想要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.06,0:36:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 说出来你都不信
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.82,0:36:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,木乃伊可以毁掉墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成一群甲虫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.16,0:36:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能诅咒任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很有趣 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拭目以待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.27,0:36:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨瑞要召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.87,0:36:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有生以来见过的最大的沙尘暴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.87,0:36:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.61,0:36:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙尘暴？我好久不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.34,0:37:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 快点 念你的小咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.15,0:37:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的 弗兰克 韦恩 格里芬 别晕倒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.97,0:37:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.57,0:37:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 在游乐场停车 看这些孩子多可爱呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天狗啊！好像很好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.61,0:38:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好说啊 梅菲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.05,0:38:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是技术不好的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.05,0:38:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是非常危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.95,0:38:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我可是玩得很溜
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能试试吗 小家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.89,0:38:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.56,0:38:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每年夏天都这么炫酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像把你车子擦花了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.25,0:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲 跟你说了 我多年苦练才这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.25,0:38:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧？那是我女朋友 衰蛋们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.13,0:39:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老婆 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老婆 更棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.30,0:39:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了 女士 你从哪里学到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.43,0:39:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害 我有个表亲是宾夕法尼亚的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些小家伙们太可爱了 丹尼斯会喜欢他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方多适合养孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.31,0:39:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,养孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.24,0:39:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么适合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.18,0:39:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就一般般吧 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我们该去我父母家了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他们说现在该到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.95,0:39:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在精灵旅社过三点了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.59,0:40:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要问一下丹尼斯的情况 行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.50,0:40:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力麦片 逗我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.37,0:40:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意 德古 他们这是爱我们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.57,0:40:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 现在怪物们可火了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你应该像我一样接受这个事实
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发布了最畅销的健身视频
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.27,0:40:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我做 女士们 右边 然后左边
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.98,0:40:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 姑娘们 看我 你们根本没在看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.71,0:40:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 八 七 六…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的风格 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连大脚怪都在德国足球联队里大显身手
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.83,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.17,0:40:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梅菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得接电话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.70,0:40:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你按得太用力了 别那么使劲
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.41,0:40:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇 醒醒 天啊 他睡得太熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.31,0:40:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 怎么这么久才接电话？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.65,0:40:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.02,0:41:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的 梅菲 我们在旅社里都挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.39,0:41:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就做些平常在旅社里做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.45,0:41:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我真受不了你的口臭了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.82,0:41:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啵
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.36,0:41:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.89,0:41:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们玩的超开心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.49,0:41:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去骑了车 还逛了小超市 这里太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.30,0:41:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看看他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.17,0:41:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.81,0:41:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 开心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.48,0:41:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么戴着墨镜？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.88,0:41:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在玩
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.02,0:41:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级英雄之类的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.85,0:41:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为 我是墨镜侠 我要拯救世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.35,0:41:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 你不用这么大声的 - 我会飞
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.02,0:41:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.63,0:41:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 墨镜侠就是用这种声音说话的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.76,0:41:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,干扰 可能是信号不好 梅菲斯 你听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.00,0:41:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得见啊 我还…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.14,0:41:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 他好像玩得挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.94,0:41:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.64,0:42:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我演墨镜侠演得真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.08,0:42:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的临场发挥能力太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.75,0:42:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听见了没？我还说了「应为」
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.78,0:42:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她玩的很开心 约翰尼全搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.62,0:42:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她骑了车 还逛了小超市 她肯定想赶紧搬过去住！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得赶快让这个宝贝变过来 我们还要多久才能到？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.82,0:42:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我可能是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.79,0:42:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几英里之前就走错了路
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别生气 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.36,0:42:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能帮我把这上面的导航打开
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我是怎么轻轻触屏的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.64,0:42:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入您的目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您了 快点输入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.94,0:42:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 丹尼索维奇 这里特别适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.48,0:42:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓人的东西 知道吗？那是你的天性
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.42,0:42:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做的只是把注意力集中在吓人这件事上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.25,0:42:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古外公？你想念外婆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.09,0:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你外婆吗？我当然想她
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.93,0:42:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每一天都很想她 她和我是命中注定在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.13,0:42:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么问这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.67,0:42:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.13,0:42:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想念谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.17,0:43:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想爸爸妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的人呢？你想不想温妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.17,0:43:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是每天都挠你痒痒 还总想舔你的那只小狗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.34,0:43:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也想啊 不过我们只是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.65,0:43:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是德古拉家族的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能和温妮那么一个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.52,0:43:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的 毛茸茸的小姑娘只做朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右转！就是这里 你个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.06,0:43:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 右转 格里芬！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.19,0:43:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 德古外公
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.47,0:43:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子很快就会像打了鸡血一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.30,0:43:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,您已到达目的地 没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.74,0:43:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错！- 我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候就来参加过这个专门为吸血鬼小孩设计的夏令营
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.05,0:43:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 吸血鬼夏令营吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.51,0:43:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢 谁会起这么难听的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是温尼帕卡卡夏令营
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.41,0:44:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 丹尼索维奇？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.17,0:44:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在这里学会变形和抓老鼠的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.31,0:44:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有学会了该如何运用我强大的能力和力量
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.31,0:44:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺好玩的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.05,0:44:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,羽毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.59,0:44:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不记得这里还教这门课了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.96,0:44:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位好啊 今晚真美 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.99,0:44:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫德纳 是这里的负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.86,0:44:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位的到访是我们的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.40,0:44:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮您的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.43,0:44:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让我的外孙丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.43,0:44:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里学习
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.24,0:44:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个红头发 还没长尖牙的小男孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.78,0:44:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有尖牙的 可能是他发育比较晚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.78,0:44:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才想到要来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.31,0:44:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能带我们参观一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如看看他们学抓老鼠的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.65,0:44:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 不过我们现在管这项活动叫「领老鼠」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.67,0:45:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 他们根本不用自己抓老鼠？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们认为这样更有助于孩子们建立自信
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.47,0:45:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.84,0:45:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠就在这里呢！你有什么不敢抓的？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.38,0:45:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的教学方法
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 外公就是在那里学会飞的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.32,0:45:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和外公一样能飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.03,0:45:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在这边练习了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于安全考虑 我们不得不降低了难度
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.40,0:45:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.74,0:45:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是教学方法啊 我在篝火那边等你们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.55,0:46:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！欢迎你们俩回家
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.25,0:46:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.49,0:46:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊 我实在是太激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.42,0:46:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的一切都这么棒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.63,0:46:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信我真的来这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你确实来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.60,0:46:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还适应吗？你是不是要白天睡觉 晚上活动？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.33,0:46:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样都可以 无所谓的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.00,0:46:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你买了这顶美美的遮阳帽 - 琳达
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要是怕不好看的话 我还准备了这件斗篷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.64,0:46:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 我们可以以后再说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.48,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了！快来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.31,0:46:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我布置了你们的卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.99,0:46:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,和精灵旅社好像
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.19,0:46:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到精灵旅社 那次玩得太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.73,0:46:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克担心他会被掏空内脏然后吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.86,0:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我告诉他 是他想得太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.86,0:46:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你吧 琳达
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.87,0:46:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.83,0:46:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近有几个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.83,0:46:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,混血家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该请他们过来坐坐
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.64,0:46:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们既然想要搬回来住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.74,0:46:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们聊聊天应该也不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.21,0:47:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡伦 你好 潘朵哥拉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.41,0:47:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你 梅菲斯 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.48,0:47:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定会喜欢这里的 根本不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.79,0:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们完全不会介意我们的生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.19,0:47:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说有时候小孩子会受点欺负
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.56,0:47:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这也能让他们变得坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.83,0:47:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊 这位是洛雷塔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.66,0:47:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她嫁给了狼人保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.70,0:47:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.37,0:47:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我正在给梅菲斯介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.97,0:47:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近其他由人类和怪物组成的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.87,0:47:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.77,0:47:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.44,0:47:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你也可以坐下来吃点杯子蛋糕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 吸血鬼永远是好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.82,0:47:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永永远远在一起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.02,0:47:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使在阳光灿烂的日子里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.29,0:47:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 吸血鬼也永远都是好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.50,0:47:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永永远远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.10,0:48:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在一起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱得真好 吸血鬼们 抱抱自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.12,0:48:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:18.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁止入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.59,0:48:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.09,0:48:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道更想去听那些无聊的新儿歌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.96,0:48:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「迈克尔把尸体送上岸」不是挺好的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.07,0:48:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有「老狼人和斧头」也不错啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.04,0:48:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古 我们不应该上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.94,0:48:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁准备好要飞了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.01,0:48:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我！我！我要像超人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.28,0:48:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更好的！像吸血鬼一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.02,0:48:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座塔摇摇欲坠的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.98,0:48:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？可能小孩子根本还不应该会飞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.35,0:48:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 小孩子们就应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.75,0:48:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们扔下去自然就会飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.59,0:48:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.23,0:48:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就想飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:49:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 你需要外公的时候 外公就会在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.06,0:49:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我不敢看了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.57,0:49:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.13,0:49:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.94,0:49:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没开始飞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.28,0:49:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.61,0:49:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.15,0:49:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这塔可够高的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.75,0:49:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才适合学习飞
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.29,0:49:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该去救他了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.62,0:49:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会摔死的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.76,0:49:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能学得比较慢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.09,0:49:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.66,0:49:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次的时候也是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.63,0:49:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离地面很近了！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.63,0:49:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 他是学不会飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.68,0:49:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了 外公一直陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.75,0:49:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次！再来一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.08,0:49:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我的天啊 我们得上报这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.82,0:49:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说要上报纸？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.45,0:49:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这样是挺酷的 但我还不想惊动媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 先生 我是要向上级汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.43,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们遇到的危险我不能隐瞒不报
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我听着 从上面飞下来是很好玩的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.76,0:50:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唱的歌才是孩子们面临的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.20,0:50:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不要下去帮帮他？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.27,0:50:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去 我早就跟他说过这样太过分了 我才不去帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把孩子的母亲叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.74,0:50:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 绝不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.34,0:50:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈妈本来就已经疯疯癫癫的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.98,0:50:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得按章办事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.65,0:50:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会按章办事的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.28,0:50:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是吸血鬼 不会被催眠的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.02,0:50:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.29,0:50:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你别逼我叫警察来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.86,0:50:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁也别叫了 行不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.63,0:50:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,着火了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.26,0:50:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑了 停下来在地上打滚就行 别跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.13,0:50:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫是没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.14,0:50:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是坏人吗 德古外公？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.58,0:50:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.38,0:51:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 你是这世界上最乖的小孩了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.22,0:51:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们放的火 是塔的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.62,0:51:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座塔早就年久失修了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.22,0:51:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没向上级汇报你就偷着乐去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.16,0:51:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 小英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.03,0:51:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为我是蝙蝠侠！我们去坐蝙蝠车！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 去坐…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.81,0:51:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 让你失望了 我估计他们也是觉得你会喜欢才这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.51,0:51:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么在这里我感觉这么别扭呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.68,0:51:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 奇怪的是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.88,0:51:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是想帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.35,0:51:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就在旅社长大 对外界一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.89,0:51:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你在圣诞老人家长大 无所不知
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.89,0:51:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣克鲁兹 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.43,0:51:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让丹尼斯在精灵旅社外面长大
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会像我一样 那么奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.30,0:51:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？梅菲斯 你很棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.84,0:51:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是充满活力和好奇心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.74,0:52:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果丹尼斯长大能像你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.04,0:52:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是世界上最幸运的爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.21,0:52:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真爱你 约翰尼斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.35,0:52:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.75,0:52:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们在一起 无论到哪里都很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.72,0:52:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是留在精灵旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.36,0:52:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.43,0:52:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.83,0:52:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看我朋友发来的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.36,0:52:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子简直是超赞的不死神童
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.67,0:52:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.64,0:52:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.77,0:52:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！那是丹尼斯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.07,0:52:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是！是吗？根本看不清楚 况且…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.84,0:52:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 删掉了 看不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.92,0:52:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？是梅菲斯 我不会接的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.03,0:52:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点吧 德古 快接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.33,0:52:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.90,0:53:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.57,0:53:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在旅社外烧烤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.61,0:53:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对安全
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.31,0:53:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？是火灾警报声吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近旅社住进来几个爱哭的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.15,0:53:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点 你们这群怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.02,0:53:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正打算举办一场绝对安全的野餐会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！我要打个招呼！妈咪！妈咪！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古外公刚才教我怎么飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.99,0:53:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 是他妈妈的电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 又有干扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.20,0:53:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就回旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是在旅社找不到你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.40,0:53:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我一定会让你后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.10,0:53:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.14,0:53:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上回家
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.84,0:53:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这就去叫醒我的背包
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.54,0:53:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们得撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.15,0:53:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有车！我们怎么离开这里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我打了个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 布罗比 我们应该早点给你打电话的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.10,0:54:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.65,0:54:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去精灵旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.82,0:54:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.22,0:54:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵旅社 最近的航班
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.66,0:54:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有直达精灵旅社的航班
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.16,0:54:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以先到布加勒斯特（罗马尼亚的首都）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.43,0:54:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在芝加哥转机 再在苏黎世转机（瑞士北部城市）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.33,0:54:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么时候才能到？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.07,0:54:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥的航班因为天气原因延迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要两张二等舱的机票吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.21,0:54:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧！- 会的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非要现在去吗？我们好不容易不堵车了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.80,0:55:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要折磨死我了 布罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.41,0:55:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头上还有云 好想自拍一张！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.48,0:55:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼！现在别拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.05,0:55:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等会再说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.63,0:55:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小摩托快没油了 我们怎么才能到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.16,0:55:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 吹气
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.03,0:56:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思吧？你怎么这么开心啊？你喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.30,0:56:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.37,0:56:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,咯吱 咯吱！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.45,0:56:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是飞行 丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.31,0:56:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像吸血鬼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 看你飞得多好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是穿斗篷的人里面最帅的 德古外公
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.93,0:57:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么时候到啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.70,0:57:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经等了…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.34,0:57:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把儿子给我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.54,0:57:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚才去吃牛油果了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.98,0:57:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！我会飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.51,0:57:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.21,0:57:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 妈妈已经疯疯癫癫 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.21,0:57:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 疯疯癫癫 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.85,0:57:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 疯疯癫癫 宝贝 宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.65,0:57:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小恶魔 我要按章办事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.42,0:57:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 绝不可以 绝不可以 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.22,0:57:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 妈妈已经 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.69,0:57:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 疯疯 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.79,0:57:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 颠颠 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.77,0:58:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来我担心丹尼斯和其他怪物一起不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.20,0:58:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我觉得他和你在一起也不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.51,0:58:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前怎么说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.94,0:58:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他是人类 怪物 还是独角兽 都没关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.41,0:58:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得他…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.62,0:58:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,周三我们在这里给他办生日宴
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.08,0:58:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.05,0:58:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 梅菲 不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.96,0:58:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你让人类住进了旅社 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.16,0:58:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在你心里 你并没有真正接受他们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.94,0:59:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的 我可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.18,0:59:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠 我是蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠 我是蝙蝠 我是蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.55,0:59:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯？你在干什么 宝贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.52,0:59:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 我抱你下来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.59,0:59:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日宴会马上到了 你激动吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.76,0:59:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.63,0:59:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜谁要来？爸爸的家人都来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.63,0:59:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克爷爷 琳达奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.93,0:59:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有疼你的哥哥姐姐 叔叔阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.74,0:59:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们会和他们一起回加利福尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.81,0:59:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 因为我不是怪物 所以我们必须搬走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.44,0:59:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不 丹尼斯 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.05,0:59:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.65,0:59:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那德古外公怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.29,0:59:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只剩下他一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.89,1:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古外公要留在这里经营旅社
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会去看我们的 我们也会回来看他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.46,1:00:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能每天晚上给他打电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.06,1:00:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.27,1:00:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.97,1:00:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.01,1:00:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜约翰尼一家到来了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.48,1:00:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们要带走德古的心爱之物 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.19,1:00:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.32,1:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 埋葬你所有的情绪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.59,1:00:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让它们在内心发酵 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.37,1:00:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你为什么要走呢？这地方真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.17,1:00:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.54,1:00:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那些超赞的僵尸怪！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.64,1:00:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是最酷的怪物？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.14,1:00:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.41,1:00:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂 真没出息
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.68,1:01:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家欢聚一堂多好啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.22,1:01:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅菲斯 你有兄弟或者姐妹吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.32,1:01:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我家只有我和我爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.52,1:01:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没问过你妈妈是怎么过世的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.23,1:01:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被愤怒的人类杀死了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.53,1:01:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好尴尬 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.43,1:01:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有爷爷瓦拉德
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.77,1:01:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有爷爷？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他会来参加宴会的 我邀请他了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.44,1:01:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你邀请他了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.54,1:01:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他都没见过丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在走之前让他们见一面
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.41,1:01:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 太好了 和蔼老人家 瓦拉德
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.75,1:01:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人有湿巾吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.21,1:01:40.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（精灵旅社 残酷山谷666号 瓦拉德收）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.57,1:01:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天狗啊 他终于邀请我了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.94,1:01:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都有外孙了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.44,1:02:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都没告诉你？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.28,1:02:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 贝拉 至少家族里多了一个吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.68,1:02:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旅社举行？够土豪嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅社里都是人类！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.66,1:02:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 闭上你的血盆大口 看看你干的好事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.36,1:02:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.36,1:02:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直教育我儿子要杀戮 仇恨 窃取人类的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.70,1:02:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.84,1:02:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 如果瓦拉德爷爷看到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.17,1:02:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和约翰尼策划的盛大的化装舞会 一定会非常开心的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.58,1:02:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.25,1:02:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,配合一点 我爸要来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.95,1:02:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有爸爸？挺有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.78,1:02:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 绝对不能让我爸知道你是人类
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.25,1:02:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全家都是人类
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.52,1:02:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？但是 德古 我很自豪的…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.03,1:02:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是让他知道了 他就会窃取你家人的灵魂 吃掉你的背包
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.33,1:02:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 各位
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把生日宴会办成怪物化装舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.84,1:03:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.14,1:03:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是丹尼斯回归
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人生活之前的最后一次狂欢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.68,1:03:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.88,1:03:10.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丹尼斯五岁生日派对）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.40,1:03:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 梅菲斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我已经喜欢上怪模怪样了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.14,1:03:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没向上级汇报你就偷着乐去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.74,1:03:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 小英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.71,1:03:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是蝙蝠侠！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.41,1:03:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！我们去坐蝙蝠车！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.46,1:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被女孩子欺负了 蝙蝠侠
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.96,1:03:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧 我不会哭的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.10,1:04:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵旅社
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.47,1:04:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到了人类的味道！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.01,1:04:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统撕碎！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.04,1:04:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我们来到外面的世界 当然有人类的味道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.65,1:04:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你在外面等我 这是我的家事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.25,1:04:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去了只会捣乱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.92,1:04:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想见见那个小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.79,1:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该认识他伟大的吸祖爷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.32,1:04:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.06,1:04:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼祖爷爷 拜托 这都听不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.83,1:04:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这宴会真棒！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.53,1:04:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.43,1:04:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的吸血鬼衣服？你是傻子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在淘宝买的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.54,1:04:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他家可以连夜发顺丰快递
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.51,1:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头上像是装了个狒狒的屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.98,1:04:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能练练说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.98,1:04:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能一口嬉皮腔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.05,1:04:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是嬉皮 是懒鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.75,1:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像吸血鬼那样说话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.18,1:05:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,吾名尖牙约翰伯爵 我是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.76,1:05:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 吸血鬼才不会四处招摇 「我是吸血鬼」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.46,1:05:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 吾名尖牙约翰伯爵
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.90,1:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在耍我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.90,1:05:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你觉得我都不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你千万别在我爸面前说
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.07,1:05:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「巴拉 巴拉 巴拉」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.91,1:05:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 凯蒂大师来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.21,1:05:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古 这是布兰登 大家都叫他凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.18,1:05:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们特意请他来给丹尼斯表演 - 你好 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.25,1:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.32,1:05:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始？半小时后我还要去参加图书义卖呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.52,1:05:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我的吸孙在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.63,1:05:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 非得这么作秀似的出场吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！你可真精神啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在开旅社了？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.00,1:05:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗王子摇身一变成了客服国王
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.84,1:05:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 见到你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.98,1:05:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会就来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.05,1:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让瓦拉德靠近人类和梅菲斯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.89,1:06:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.89,1:06:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这身装扮真不赖
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.43,1:06:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个闻起来很有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.96,1:06:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是欧洲人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.63,1:06:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫体香剂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.27,1:06:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别侮辱了整个大陆 琳达
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.37,1:06:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵！最近过得怎么样啊？我叫弗兰肯斯坦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.51,1:06:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 其实我是弗兰肯斯坦的怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.74,1:06:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦 他是一个医生…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再说吧 把我家人叫来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.65,1:06:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你介绍下你儿子的其他朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.92,1:06:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是墨瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.68,1:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀我！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.42,1:06:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 哟 V！最近怎样啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.29,1:06:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会说话的厕纸 这挺新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.46,1:06:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！孩子在哪里？我想要见他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.80,1:06:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.93,1:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是德古拉的女婿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.87,1:06:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尖牙约翰伯爵
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.77,1:06:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉 巴拉 大黑羊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.24,1:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有羊毛吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.28,1:07:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头上是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.18,1:07:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像是我奶奶的胸部
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.22,1:07:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 那个长得很搞笑的人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.35,1:07:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的曾孙了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.62,1:07:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.86,1:07:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看那些尖牙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.56,1:07:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.86,1:07:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是太爱他了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.76,1:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要正对着他的尖牙抱着他
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.00,1:07:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一遍 让我看看那些尖牙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.98,1:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的尖牙长得比较慢 就像你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.15,1:07:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就像我一样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.62,1:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个大人物以前是一个爱哭鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.39,1:07:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 以前是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.72,1:07:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还尿床
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.89,1:07:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.43,1:07:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要吓唬吓唬他 尖牙就长出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓出尖牙？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.00,1:07:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这个硬汉的尖牙就是我吓唬出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.73,1:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要控制住一样尖牙长得慢的人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.30,1:08:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得很亲切很无辜的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就像这样 然后…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.47,1:08:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.54,1:08:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这样就能把尖牙吓出来 对吧 德古？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.71,1:08:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 伙计们 如果图书义卖迟到了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就赶不上集市了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.95,1:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.35,1:08:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要控制住他？但是丹尼斯会很伤心的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.22,1:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听明白吗？这是我们的通行证
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.39,1:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能成功的话 砰！丹尼索维奇就变成吸血鬼了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.26,1:08:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就都能住在这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.16,1:08:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.87,1:08:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.87,1:08:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 大家请坐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.97,1:08:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯给你们准备了一个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.47,1:08:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,独一无二的凯蒂 「蛋糕怪物」！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们！我是凯蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.88,1:08:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美好的凯蒂的一天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.29,1:08:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我有个问题 谁喜欢蛋糕啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.63,1:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,升！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.07,1:09:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么飘起来了？舞台监督能来一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.84,1:09:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.25,1:09:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕了吗 丹尼索维奇？有没感觉到什么？有没有什么变化？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.42,1:09:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.22,1:09:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要全部的蛋糕 懦夫才和别人分享
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.03,1:09:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得在电视里看过这些
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.50,1:09:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得在蓝光碟里看过 是附加内容
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.40,1:09:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 瓦拉德爷爷怎么在那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.98,1:09:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 我好怕 凯蒂怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.22,1:09:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你吃蛋糕 而是蛋糕吃你！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.69,1:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.19,1:10:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.69,1:10:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？我要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家长最好都别上大众点评评论
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.10,1:10:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.97,1:10:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几秒钟
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.97,1:10:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子的尖牙可能就长出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.51,1:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 这不值得
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.11,1:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么不值得？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.14,1:10:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次尝试让孩子变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.74,1:10:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你留下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.61,1:10:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这个 你就毁了他最爱的东西？你怎么可以这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经绝望了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.78,1:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也跟他是一伙的？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.72,1:10:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯在我的家乡不会快乐的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.22,1:10:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯根本就没去过那里
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.06,1:10:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 此时夫妻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.39,1:10:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 剑拔弩张 冲突爆发 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.49,1:10:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.26,1:10:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰尼 丹尼斯不是怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.90,1:10:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢牛油果
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不让他吃别的好东西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.67,1:10:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想丹尼斯只想成为正常人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.90,1:10:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不说「正常」这个词吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.31,1:10:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们住的地方 他就是正常的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.64,1:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是他 你不能改变他 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.38,1:11:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯 你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.88,1:11:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.02,1:11:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你自己在外面很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.46,1:11:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方 我们可以躲在那里 跟着我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.87,1:11:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没阻止我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.40,1:11:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的曾孙就不会像这里的小邋遢一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.57,1:11:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子都是懦弱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.24,1:11:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懦弱的人？- 约翰尼 冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.17,1:11:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老人家 你想被干翻吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.31,1:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我1997年可就获得了黄带认证
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.01,1:11:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.25,1:11:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又怎么回事？你不是吸血鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.42,1:11:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.99,1:11:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然是人类了 他是我们的儿子 你以为我们是怪物吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.69,1:11:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！你竟然让你女儿嫁给了人类 还生了个人类的孩子？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.56,1:11:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干脆拿棍子刺穿我的心脏好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.80,1:11:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再厌恶人类了 他们也不讨厌我们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.71,1:12:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.04,1:12:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.51,1:12:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的曾孙是我见过的最贴心 最善良
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.25,1:12:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最特别的男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.08,1:12:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果因为他有一半人类的血液
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.22,1:12:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能给他应有的疼爱
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.99,1:12:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你才是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.86,1:12:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.19,1:12:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯哪里去了？丹尼斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.86,1:12:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.20,1:12:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 丹尼斯 我给你做了点吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.24,1:12:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死鸽子？- 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我一旦从商学院毕业
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.21,1:12:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,经营公司以后
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.34,1:12:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就再也吃不到这种家常便饭了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要搬走 温妮 搬到加利福利亚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.72,1:12:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈觉得我在这里不开心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.55,1:12:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为我脸上没有你那样的毛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.09,1:12:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我不是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.56,1:12:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你很完美 你是我认识的最好的男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我还有300个兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.03,1:12:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也很好 温妮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.37,1:13:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 小男孩和他的宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.77,1:13:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼斯！- 丹尼索维奇！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.64,1:13:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在房间
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.91,1:13:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没在泳池旁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不在这个汤罐里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.18,1:13:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么会邀请你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.15,1:13:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！丹尼斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.75,1:13:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼索维奇！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.79,1:13:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.20,1:13:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.07,1:13:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.14,1:13:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是错的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.17,1:13:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么别人都不懂呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类不能和怪兽相处
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.75,1:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才错了！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没错！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.58,1:13:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿你们当人质
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.49,1:13:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和手下们要把那个
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.49,1:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎人类的旅社拆个稀巴烂
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.72,1:13:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.29,1:13:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.03,1:14:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.30,1:14:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.36,1:14:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,应为这样德古外公会伤心的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.60,1:14:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,会伤心 那你打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.44,1:14:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.51,1:14:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你为什么不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.54,1:14:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你只是一个柔弱的小男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.18,1:14:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.75,1:14:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.02,1:14:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 温妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.75,1:14:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.55,1:15:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！他在那里 就在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.72,1:15:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.22,1:15:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大男孩！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.83,1:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯 我们都在找你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.03,1:15:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的甜心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.39,1:15:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.10,1:15:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的坏朋友来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.27,1:15:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好玩了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.27,1:16:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.32,1:17:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太棒了 丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.89,1:17:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是说丹尼索维奇
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.05,1:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.07,1:17:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯 我来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.91,1:17:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道付出总有收获的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.96,1:17:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你们最好赶紧飞走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.87,1:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,德古外公 我是一只吸血鬼 也是一个超级英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.47,1:18:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很酷吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.41,1:18:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,何止是现在？丹尼斯 你一直都很酷
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.98,1:18:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是人类 吸血鬼 还是独角兽 你在我心中都是完美的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.75,1:18:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我是一个吸血鬼 那我们可以待在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.92,1:18:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.19,1:18:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.42,1:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.83,1:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们要知道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.83,1:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个假期我们都会来看你们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.96,1:18:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.75,1:18:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后休想靠近我和我的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.19,1:18:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.53,1:19:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你刚救了一个人类
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.54,1:19:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是迫于压力啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.94,1:19:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心这孩子的尖牙什么时候长出来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢？我的牙几年前就掉了！看
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 爸爸 趁我们还没吐 赶紧放回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.78,1:19:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像现在还是某人的生日吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.54,1:20:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起唱吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.18,1:20:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我干的
